WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,260
How can there be fruit after the apocalypse?

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,660
Aren’t they all mutated?

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:07,620
Please have tea

4
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,640
Boss Xia

5
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,220
I have to leave today

6
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,780
Could you please Boss Xia to sort out some supplies?

7
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:13,900
I'll take some of it first

8
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:18,500
Boss Xia shouldn't be able to start from scratch, right?

9
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,750
what do you need

10
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:21,990
Get ten packs of sanitary napkins first

11
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:23,710
Take away fifteen portions of the lunch boxes from the lunch machine

12
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:24,990
I can only take so much for now

13
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,110
I will be back soon

14
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,190
One week at most

15
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:30,920
The front line is more than a thousand kilometers away from here

16
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:31,840
Travel day and night

17
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,000
Use up all your artistic abilities

18
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,320
We can arrive within three days

19
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:37,380
You still need to go through approval when you come back.

20
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:44,110
Guest fruits are also for sale

21
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:46,400
Need to buy?

22
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,440
It's very sweet. Try it.

23
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,480
this is too expensive
